<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel opens 3.21 percent lower.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel opens 3.21 percent lower.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Eurotunnel opened 3.21 percent lower on the Paris bourse after a fire overnight injured 34 people and forced a closure of the tunnel.</p>
<p>Authorities said they expected to have the tunnel operating in some capacity by midday.</p>
<p>At 0903 GMT the share was steady at its opening level of 7.55 francs.</p>
<p>--  Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
